"USAGE_FOOTER" = "Tap the CarDuo button on the CarPlay dock (just above Home) to show a panel with 3 sections: Default (2 boxes / 3 boxes / 1 large + 2: the open app goes to box 1, the other boxes show an app picker), Recent (the last 3 splits, tap to reopen the same apps and layout), Favorites (the pairs below). Holding an app icon for 1 second opens the same panel. While split, the CarDuo button switches the layout (apps keep their box order; with fewer boxes the last apps go to the background). Drag the bars between boxes to resize, tap a knob for Swap / Ratio / Close. White tab on each box: Choose app / Full screen (tap again to shrink back) / Only this app / Close app (last, after a divider). Closing an app removes its box (3 becomes 2, 2 becomes 1 = back to full screen). The CarPlay Home button closes the split.";

